        Phrase("Tu as vu le match ?", "Did you see the match?", "Uliiona mechi?", "Uliiona game?", "voir → vu. Irregular participle, memorize.", "Big irregulars: vu, pris, mis, dit, écrit, fait, bu, lu, su, eu, été. Exam core.", "A2", true),
        Phrase("Je suis allé au stade", "I went to the stadium (m)", "Nilikwenda uwanjani", "Nilienda stadium", "aller takes ÊTRE. Agreement: allé/allée/allés/allées.", "DR MRS VANDERTRAMP verbs take être: aller, venir, partir, sortir, monter… Agreement with subject.", "A2"),
        Phrase("Elle est venue tôt", "She came early", "Alikuja mapema", null, "Feminine +e: venue. Agreement shows in writing.", "Elle est venue, ils sont partis. In speech it's silent — exams test spelling.", "A2"),
