        Phrase("Le prof qui explique bien", "The teacher who explains well", "Mwalimu anayefafanua vizuri", null, "qui = subject (who/which).", "qui replaces the SUBJECT: l'ami qui rit, le bus qui part. No preposition possible.", "B1", true),
        Phrase("Le livre que je lis", "The book I'm reading", "Kitabu ninachosoma", null, "que = object (whom/which).", "que replaces the OBJECT: le film que je regarde. qui = does the action, que = receives it.", "B1"),
        Phrase("La ville où je suis né", "The town where I was born", "Mji niliozaliwa", null, "où = where/when.", "où for place AND time: le jour où tout a changé. Accent mandatory — ou without it means 'or'.", "B1"),
        Phrase("Le film dont je parle", "The film I'm talking about", "Filamu ninayoizungumzia", null, "parler DE → dont. Never 'de que'.", "Verbs with de (parler de, avoir besoin de, se souvenir de) → dont: l'ami dont je suis fier.", "B1"),
        Phrase("Ce qui compte, c'est toi", "What matters is you", "Muhimu ni wewe", null, "ce qui = what (subject).", "Headless relatives: ce qui (does), ce que (receives), ce dont (de-verbs). Ce qui m'énerve…", "B2"),
        Phrase("Fais ce que tu veux", "Do what you want", "Fanya unachotaka", "Fanya unachotaka", "ce que = what (object).", "Je fais ce que je peux. Dis-moi ce que tu penses. The workhorse of opinions.", "B1"),
        Phrase("L'examen pour lequel je stresse", "The exam I'm stressing about", "Mtihani ninaohangaikia", null, "Verb with other prepositions → lequel forms.", "pour/sur/avec + qui (people) or lequel/laquelle (things): l'ami avec qui, la table sur laquelle.", "B2"),
        Phrase("Il n'y a pas de quoi", "You're welcome (lit: nothing to fuss)", "Hakuna shida", "Hakuna noma", "de quoi = about what / to fuss over.", "Fixed expressions: il n'y a pas de quoi, de quoi parler, avoir de quoi manger. B2 naturalness.", "B2"),
        Phrase("Qui dort dîne", "Who sleeps, dines (proverb)", "Alalaye hadhaiki", null, "Headless qui: whoever. Proverb bonus.", "Proverbs = free B2 cultural marks: Qui vivra verra. Petit à petit, l'oiseau fait son nid.", "B2"),
        Phrase("La raison pour laquelle", "The reason why", "Sababu ambayo", null, "pour laquelle: feminine agreement with raison.", "lequel agrees: lequel/laquelle/lesquels/lesquelles. Match the noun it replaces.", "B2"),
        Phrase("L'homme avec qui je travaille", "The man I work with", "Mwanaume ninaefanya naye kazi", null, "avec + qui (people).", "avec/sans/pour + qui for people; + lequel-forms for things. People get qui.", "B2"),
        Phrase("Tout ce que je sais", "All that I know", "Kila kitu ninachojua", null, "tout ce que: everything that.", "Tout ce que / tout ce qui: background phrases. Tout ce que je veux, c'est dormir.", "B1"),
