        Phrase("Qui vivra verra", "Who lives shall see", "Mwenye kuishi ataona", "Time will tell", "Headless qui proverb.", "Proverbs = free culture marks. Qui dort dîne. Petit à petit… Deploy one per essay.", "B2")
