        Phrase("À ta place, je partirais", "In your shoes, I'd leave", "Kama ningekuwa wewe ningeondoka", null, "Advice: conditionnel without si.", "À ta place, je… / Tu devrais… / Il vaudrait mieux… Advice trio for dialogues and letters.", "B1"),
