        Phrase("Expliquez « il pleut des cordes »", "Explain 'it's raining ropes'", "Eleza 'mvua inanyesha kamba'", null, "Idiom explanation = own words.", "Expliquez l'expression: sens propre → sens figuré → contexte. Never copy the passage.", "B1"),
        Phrase("Quelle est la morale ?", "What is the moral?", "Funzo ni lipi?", null, "Morals hide in the last paragraph.", "La morale / la leçon: last lines + title. Quote one, reformulate one.", "B1"),
